{"schema_version": 2, "sample_id": "case6", "messages": [{"role": "user", "type": "text", "content": "A third-person aerial view centers a small red dragon flying through the middle of a large circular ring of golden light. Its orange-red wings spread wide against a brilliant blue sky, with sunlit white clouds, floating stone islands, and distant castle towers surrounding the flight path. Gold sparks trace the ring's rim and illuminate the dragon's scales and horns, while the symmetrical composition emphasizes the bright portal against the deep blue atmosphere."}, {"role": "target", "type": "video", "reference_frame_count": 0, "output": {"frames": 241, "height": 352, "width": 640}, "controls": [{"type": "text_prompt_interval", "segments": [{"start": 1, "end": 121, "text": "The aerial third-person view stays centered on the small red dragon flying through the brilliant blue sky toward the circular ring of golden light. White clouds, floating stone islands, and distant castle towers surround the symmetrical flight path as sparks stream around the ring. The dragon beats its orange-red wings and passes directly through the glowing center, its horns and scales flashing warm gold as the bright rim slides along its body. A burst of bright golden sparks flares from the rim at the moment of passage. It emerges beyond the ring without changing direction, ending in steady forward flight with wings extended and the intact circle glowing behind it."}, {"start": 121, "end": 241, "text": "The red dragon continues flying forward above the sunlit clouds with the golden ring now directly behind its tail. The circle fractures into luminous curved bands and showers of fine sparks, but the pieces do not fall away. They twist into several swirling loops that stream after the dragon, wrapping the flight path in ribbons of warm gold while the dragon maintains a level course between the floating islands. Gold light continues flickering across the clouds and the dragon's scales as the trailing loops tighten behind its wings. The glowing fragments lengthen into a bright trailing spiral, ending with the small dragon still flying ahead and the transformed ring following closely through the blue sky."}]}]}]}
